# Keys trusted to sign the vendor data (vendors/MANIFEST.sig), compiled into
# tpm2-verifier. Format of ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS, ssh-ed25519 keys only:
#
#   <principal> [namespaces="tpm2-verifier-vendors"] ssh-ed25519 <base64 key> [comment]
#
# Sign after every change of vendors/ (tpm2-verifier store manifest):
#
#   ssh-keygen -Y sign -f <key> -n tpm2-verifier-vendors vendors/MANIFEST
